msgid "Cedulio"
msgstr "Cedulio"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: cedulio.php
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/cedulio/"
msgstr "https://es.wordpress.org/plugins/tax-id-checkout/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: cedulio.php
msgid ""
"Ask for the right tax ID in every country (CPF/CNPJ, RUC, CUIT, RUT, RFC, "
"NIF, VAT number…) with real check-digit validation, plus house number, "
"neighborhood and postcode autofill. Works with the block and the classic "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"Pide el documento fiscal correcto en cada país (CPF/CNPJ, RUC, CUIT, RUT, "
"RFC, NIF, número de IVA…) con validación real del dígito verificador, además"
" de número de casa, barrio y autocompletado por código postal. Funciona con "
"el checkout de bloques y el clásico."

#. Author of the plugin
#: cedulio.php
msgid "Marcos Arellano"
msgstr "Marcos Arellano"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: cedulio.php
msgid "https://marcos-arellano.vercel.app"
msgstr "https://marcos-arellano.vercel.app"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-admin.php:31
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-admin.php:47
msgid ""
"Cedulio already adds CPF/CNPJ, house number and neighborhood, and "
"keeps the same order data. Deactivate \"Brazilian Market on WooCommerce\" so"
" customers do not see those fields twice."
msgstr ""
"Cedulio ya agrega CPF/CNPJ, número y barrio, y guarda los mismos "
"datos del pedido. Desactiva \"Brazilian Market on WooCommerce\" para que tus"
" clientes no vean esos campos dos veces."

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-admin.php:52
msgid ""
"Your Brazilian Market settings were imported. Orders and customers keep "
"their CPF, CNPJ, number and neighborhood."
msgstr ""
"Se importaron tus ajustes de Brazilian Market. Los pedidos y clientes "
"conservan su CPF, CNPJ, número y barrio."

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-admin.php:66
msgid ""
"Company lookup: type a CNPJ (Brazil) or an EU VAT number and the company "
"name and address fill in by themselves"
msgstr ""
"Búsqueda de empresa: escribe un CNPJ (Brasil) o un número de IVA de la UE y "
"la razón social y la dirección se completan solas"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-admin.php:67
msgid ""
"Discount by payment method: e.g. 10% off with bank transfer, Pix or cash, in"
" both checkouts"
msgstr ""
"Descuento por método de pago: por ejemplo 10% menos con transferencia, Pix o"
" efectivo, en ambos checkouts"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-admin.php:68
msgid ""
"Instalments and discounted price under every price: \"12 × $10.00 interest-"
"free\" and \"$95.00 by bank transfer\""
msgstr ""
"Cuotas y precio con descuento debajo de cada precio: \"12 cuotas de $10,00 "
"sin interés\" y \"$95,00 con transferencia\""

