msgstr "Sí, en todos los países"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:101
msgid "Only in the countries below"
msgstr "Solo en los países de abajo"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:108
msgid "Required in"
msgstr "Obligatorio en"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:114
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "Validación"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:116
msgid "Check digits (recommended)"
msgstr "Dígito verificador (recomendado)"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:117
msgid "Format only"
msgstr "Solo formato"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:118
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Desactivada"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:120
msgid ""
"Check digits catch typos in CPF, CNPJ, RUC, CUIT, RUT, NIT, NIF, Codice "
"fiscale and more. Countries without a public rule are checked for format "
"only."
msgstr ""
"El dígito verificador detecta errores de tipeo en CPF, CNPJ, RUC, CUIT, RUT,"
" NIT, NIF, Codice fiscale y más. En los países sin una regla pública solo se"
" revisa el formato."

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:126
msgid "House number field"
msgstr "Campo de número"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:127
msgid ""
"Countries where the house number gets its own field. Leave empty to never "
"show it."
msgstr ""
"Países donde el número de casa tiene su propio campo. Déjalo vacío para no "
"mostrarlo nunca."

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:133
msgid "House number required"
msgstr "Número obligatorio"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:134
msgid "Required (customers can type \"S/N\" when there is none)"
msgstr "Obligatorio (pueden escribir \"S/N\" si no tiene)"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:140
msgid "Neighborhood field"
msgstr "Campo de barrio"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:141
msgid ""
"Countries where the neighborhood (bairro, barrio, colonia) gets its own "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Países donde el barrio (bairro, barrio, colonia) tiene su propio campo."

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:147
msgid "Neighborhood required"
msgstr "Barrio obligatorio"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:154
msgid "Postcode autofill"
msgstr "Autocompletar por código postal"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:155
msgid "Fill in the address from the postcode"
msgstr "Completar la dirección a partir del código postal"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:156
msgid ""
"Brazil: street, neighborhood, city and state (ViaCEP, with BrasilAPI as "
"backup). About 60 other countries: city and state (Zippopotam.us). Only the "
"postcode and country are sent, and answers are cached on your site."
msgstr ""
"Brasil: calle, barrio, ciudad y estado (ViaCEP, con BrasilAPI de respaldo). "
"Unos 60 países más: ciudad y estado (Zippopotam.us). Solo se envían el "
"código postal y el país, y las respuestas se guardan en tu sitio."

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:375
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Activado"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:383
msgid "Choose countries…"
msgstr "Elige países…"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout-settings.php:395
msgid "Choose…"
msgstr "Elige…"

#: includes/class-tax-id-checkout.php:115
msgid "Cedulio needs WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr "Cedulio necesita que WooCommerce esté instalado y activo."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:37
msgid "Discount by payment method (Pro)"
msgstr "Descuento por método de pago (Pro)"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:38
msgid ""
"For example 10% off when paying by bank transfer, Pix or cash. Shown as a "
"line in the order totals."
msgstr ""
"Por ejemplo 10% menos al pagar con transferencia, Pix o efectivo. Se muestra"
" como una línea en los totales del pedido."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:60
msgid "Payment methods"
msgstr "Métodos de pago"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:67
msgid "Discount (%)"
msgstr "Descuento (%)"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:68
msgid ""
"Applied to the products (after coupons), not to shipping. 0 turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica a los productos (después de los cupones), no al envío. 0 lo "
"desactiva."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:74
msgid "Line name in the totals"
msgstr "Nombre de la línea en los totales"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-discount.php:75
msgid "Payment method discount"
msgstr "Descuento por método de pago"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:33
msgid "Instalments and discounted price (Pro)"
msgstr "Cuotas y precio con descuento (Pro)"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:34
msgid ""
"Shown under the price in the shop and on product pages. Display only: your "
"payment provider decides the real instalments."
msgstr ""
"Se muestran debajo del precio en la tienda y en la página del producto. Es "
"solo informativo: las cuotas reales las define tu medio de pago."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:49
msgid "Maximum instalments"
msgstr "Máximo de cuotas"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:50
msgid "0 hides the instalments."
msgstr "0 oculta las cuotas."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:56
msgid "Interest-free up to"
msgstr "Sin interés hasta"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:57
msgid "Number of instalments without interest."
msgstr "Cantidad de cuotas sin interés."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:63
msgid "Monthly interest (%)"
msgstr "Interés mensual (%)"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:64
msgid "Used when the maximum is above the interest-free instalments."
msgstr "Se usa cuando el máximo supera las cuotas sin interés."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:70
msgid "Minimum instalment value"
msgstr "Valor mínimo de cada cuota"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:71
msgid ""
"Fewer instalments are shown so that each one is at least this amount. 0 for "
"no minimum."
msgstr ""
"Se muestran menos cuotas para que cada una sea al menos este monto. 0 para "
"no tener mínimo."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:77
msgid "Interest-free text"
msgstr "Texto sin interés"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:78
#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:85
msgid "Tags: {count} {amount}"
msgstr "Etiquetas: {count} {amount}"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:79
msgid "or {count} × {amount} interest-free"
msgstr "o {count} cuotas de {amount} sin interés"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:84
msgid "Text with interest"
msgstr "Texto con interés"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:86
msgid "or up to {count} × {amount}"
msgstr "o hasta {count} cuotas de {amount}"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:91
msgid "Discounted price text"
msgstr "Texto del precio con descuento"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:92
msgid ""
"Shown when a payment method discount is set. Tags: {price} {method} "
"{percent}. Leave empty to hide."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra cuando hay un descuento por método de pago. Etiquetas: {price} "
"{method} {percent}. Déjalo vacío para ocultarlo."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-installments.php:93
msgid "{price} with {method}"
msgstr "{price} con {method}"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:44
msgid "Company lookup (Pro)"
msgstr "Búsqueda de empresa (Pro)"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:59
msgid "Company lookup"
msgstr "Búsqueda de empresa"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:60
msgid ""
"Fill in the company name and address from a CNPJ (Brazil) or EU VAT number"
msgstr ""
"Completar la razón social y la dirección a partir de un CNPJ (Brasil) o un "
"número de IVA de la UE"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:61
msgid ""
"Uses BrasilAPI for CNPJ and the European Commission's VIES service for VAT "
"numbers. Answers are cached for 7 days."
msgstr ""
"Usa BrasilAPI para el CNPJ y el servicio VIES de la Comisión Europea para "
"los números de IVA. Las respuestas se guardan 7 días."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:67
msgid "Check EU VAT numbers"
msgstr "Verificar números de IVA de la UE"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:68
msgid "Reject VAT numbers that VIES reports as not registered"
msgstr "Rechazar los números de IVA que VIES informa como no registrados"

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:69
msgid "When VIES is down the number is accepted, so no order is lost."
msgstr "Si VIES no responde, el número se acepta para no perder pedidos."

#: includes/pro/class-tax-id-checkout-pro-lookup.php:278
msgid ""
"This VAT number is not registered in the EU VIES system. Please check it, or"
" leave the field empty to buy without it."
msgstr ""
"Este número de IVA no está registrado en el sistema VIES de la UE. Revísalo "
"o deja el campo vacío para comprar sin él."
